  "fullDescription": "Bring the magic of the ocean to your creative projects with this Watercolor Under the Sea Clipart Set! Featuring 71 beautifully hand-painted PNG files, this collection is perfect for ocean-themed invitations, baby shower decor, scrapbooking, sublimation, and more. Whether you’re creating for a beach-themed party, a nautical nursery, or DIY crafts, these charming watercolor illustrations will add a whimsical, underwater touch to your designs.\n\n✨ What’s Included?\n✔ 71 high-resolution PNG files (300 DPI, transparent background).\n✔ Hand-painted watercolor sea creatures & ocean elements.\n\n✔ A variety of sea animals clipart, including:\n🐋 Whale Clipart & Dolphin Clipart.\n🐙 Octopus Clipart & Jellyfish Watercolor PNG.\n🐢 Sea Turtle Clipart & Marine Animals PNG.\n🌟 Starfish and Seahorse Clipart.\n🐠 Tropical Fish PNG & Coral Reef Illustration.\n🦀 Crabs, Shells, and Other Underwater Creatures Clipart.\n\n✔ Ocean elements & decorative graphics:\n🌊 Seaweed and Coral Reef PNG.\n🏝️ Seashell Clipart & Beach-Themed Graphics.\n✔ Instant digital download – start designing right away!\n\n🐠 Perfect For:\n✅ Ocean-themed party invitations & birthday graphics.\n✅ Baby shower clipart & undersea watercolor nursery decor.\n✅ Scrapbooking, card making & DIY crafts.\n✅ Printable wall art, planners & stickers.\n✅ T-shirt designs, mugs & sublimation projects.\n✅ Mermaid and fantasy sea art.\n✅ Nautical branding, logos, and social media graphics.\n\n💖 Why You’ll Love This Set?\n🌊 Unique hand-painted watercolor illustrations for a soft, artistic touch.\n🌊 Versatile & easy to use in both digital and print projects.\n🌊 Trendy undersea clipart for kids, events, and businesses.\n🌊 Perfect for personal and small business use.\n\n🦀 Dive into creativity with this enchanting Watercolor Under the Sea Clipart Set! Whether you’re designing nautical party decorations, baby shower printables, or ocean-inspired products, this collection has everything you need.",
